{
    "title": "Merge Mansion",
    "description": "Welcome to Hopewell Bay! A crumbling old mansion needs some serious TLC\u2026 and there\u2019s also a mystery to solve. Can you get to the bottom of what Grandma is hiding?\r\n\r\nUnlock spaces and rooms in the garden and mansion, and uncover clues about the Boulton family\u2019s many secrets. Meet fascinating characters, find new clues and complete tasks to unlock more of the story.\r\n\r\nRelax into this cozy merge game and story packed with more twists and turns than Grandma\u2019s knitting.\r\n\r\nMATCH & MERGE\r\nMerge matching items to create new ones and complete the tasks. Enjoy the satisfaction of restoring the mansion and let the story unfold.\r\n\r\n\r\nRESTORE & DESIGN\r\nRestore the mansion and grounds to their former glory, collect themed decorations and customize your cottage and garden.\r\n\r\n\r\nINVESTIGATE & SOLVE\r\nUncover secret areas and collect clues to find out what Grandma is hiding. , and how far the roots of these secrets really reach\u2026\r\n\r\nEXCITING EVENTS\r\nPlay events to score points, claim gorgeous decorations, and win awesome prizes.\r\n\r\nHopewell Bay is the number one destination for a cozy getaway - and it never gets boring! Download Merge Mansion now and start your journey.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\n\r\nDid you get stuck or run into a problem? Visit our support page in the Merge Mansion app or send us a message at mergemansionsupport@metacoregames.com.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\n\r\nMerge Mansion is free to download and play. Some in-game items can also be purchased for real money. You can turn off the payment feature by disabling in-app purchases in your device\u2019s settings. Merge Mansion may offer randomized virtual items for purchase.\r\n\r\nMerge Mansion may be updated from time to time for content or technical updates. If you do not install the provided updates, Merge Mansion may not function properly or at all.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Hopewell Bay! A crumbling old mansion needs some serious TLC\u2026 and there\u2019s also a mystery to solve. Can you get to the bottom of what Grandma is hiding?<br><br>Unlock spaces and rooms in the garden and mansion, and uncover clues about the Boulton family\u2019s many secrets. Meet fascinating characters, find new clues and complete tasks to unlock more of the story.<br><br>Relax into this cozy merge game and story packed with more twists and turns than Grandma\u2019s knitting.<br><br>MATCH &amp; MERGE<br>Merge matching items to create new ones and complete the tasks. Enjoy the satisfaction of restoring the mansion and let the story unfold.<br><br><br>RESTORE &amp; DESIGN<br>Restore the mansion and grounds to their former glory, collect themed decorations and customize your cottage and garden.<br><br><br>INVESTIGATE &amp; SOLVE<br>Uncover secret areas and collect clues to find out what Grandma is hiding. , and how far the roots of these secrets really reach\u2026<br><br>EXCITING EVENTS<br>Play events to score points, claim gorgeous decorations, and win awesome prizes.<br><br>Hopewell Bay is the number one destination for a cozy getaway - and it never gets boring! Download Merge Mansion now and start your journey.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br><br>Did you get stuck or run into a problem? Visit our support page in the Merge Mansion app or send us a message at mergemansionsupport@metacoregames.com.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br><br>Merge Mansion is free to download and play. Some in-game items can also be purchased for real money. You can turn off the payment feature by disabling in-app purchases in your device\u2019s settings. Merge Mansion may offer randomized virtual items for purchase.<br><br>Merge Mansion may be updated from time to time for content or technical updates. If you do not install the provided updates, Merge Mansion may not function properly or at all.",
